        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e142575-830c-4e58-8bdb-8d39b613e406).Image",
        "Description": "It is clear that Judgement Day were recieving toxic gas from an insider within the Sapienza lab. A detailed investigation has led to Hilda Berg being named the most likely subject. A Swedish-American scientist, Hilda Berg has a history with shady business dealings, having previously supplied government secrets and chemical compounds to terroist organisations. Hilda Berg will be meeting with Dhakwan Rafiq from Judgement Day in Marrakesh. You must eliminate the targets and end their negotiations.",
